<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>I’ve given up the world because</l><l>I’ve found something better:</l><l>I have found the Living One</l><l>And He breaks every fetter.</l><l>Yes, He’s the One who set me free.</l><l>Oh, how my spirit soars!</l><l>I called His name, I’m not the same,</l><l>I am for the Lord!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
